# Node / docs-site
#
# node_modules was committed (11,430 files), and the only platform-specific
# optional deps present were win32 — @esbuild/win32-x64, @img/sharp-win32-x64,
# @rolldown/binding-win32-x64-msvc, @astrojs/compiler-binding-win32-x64-msvc.
# CI survived because docs-deploy.yml runs `npm ci`, which wipes and reinstalls,
# but a macOS or Linux contributor cloning and running `npm run build` without
# `npm ci` first hit a hard native-module load failure. package-lock.json is what
# pins the tree; the tree itself does not belong in git.
node_modules/
docs-site/dist/
